{
  "out": "/tmp/photonz-playtest/ask-live-request-at-the-top-walk",
  "seed": "one-agent-pane-on-the-right-a-plain-history-of-r: at Next defaults, the live request sits at the top of the Agent group with its words, what it is doing now and Stop, and stopping one leaves no row and nothing on the canvas. Needs the model on the Mac, as ask-stops-a-running-request-walk does.",
  "clock": 420,
  "setup": {
    "forget": [
